        "credits": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "type": "reporter",
            "value": "F5 acknowledges Sina Kheirkhah (SinSinology) of watchtower for bringing this issue to our attention and following the highest standards of coordinated disclosure."
          }
        ],
        "datePublic": "2026-11-18T15:00:00.000Z",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "supportingMedia": [
              {
                "base64": false,
                "type": "text/html",
                "value": "<p>Description:</p><p>\n\n</p><div><div><p>When BIG-IP APM is provisioned, an Access Profile is configured as a SAML SP (Service Provider) and is applied to a virtual server, undisclosed requests can cause the Traffic Management Microkernel (TMM) to terminate.<br><br>Impact:</p></div></div><p>Traffic\nis disrupted while the TMM process restarts. This vulnerability allows a remote unauthenticated attacker to cause a denial-of-service (DoS) on the BIG-IP system.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThere\nis no control plane exposure; this is a data plane issue only.</p><p></p>\n\n\nNote: Software versions which have reached End of Technical Support (EoTS) are not evaluated."
              }
            ],
            "value": "Description:\n\n\n\n\n\nWhen BIG-IP APM is provisioned, an Access Profile is configured as a SAML SP (Service Provider) and is applied to a virtual server, undisclosed requests can cause the Traffic Management Microkernel (TMM) to terminate.\n\nImpact:\n\n\n\n\n\nTraffic\nis disrupted while the TMM process restarts. This vulnerability allows a remote unauthenticated attacker to cause a denial-of-service (DoS) on the BIG-IP system.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nThere\nis no control plane exposure; this is a data plane issue only.\n\n\n\n\n\n\nNote: Software versions which have reached End of Technical Support (EoTS) are not evaluated."
          }
        ],
