        "title": "BIG-IP APM SAML Vulnerability",
        "workarounds": [
          {
            "lang": "en",
            "supportingMedia": [
              {
                "base64": false,
                "type": "text/html",
                "value": "<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">(1) If SAML SP is not required, remove the SAML Auth agent from the APM access policy. <br>(2) Restrict network access to the virtual server hosting the SAML SP to trusted client networks.</span>\n\n<br>"
